# Demo: querying openssl changelog via gemini-cli + rpm-mcp
# Prerequisites: PostgreSQL running, rpm-mcp database populated

Output docs/vhs/demo_changelog.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 800
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Molokai"

Type "gemini -y"
Enter
Sleep 10s
Type "what are the recent security-related changelog entries for openssl?"
Enter
Sleep 3m
